cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these data or this software, please cite them as below, and credit the original data sources."
type: software
title: "Airmid Éireann: Ireland's Open Pharma Data Project"
abstract: >-
  Open datasets on medicines, clinical trials, approvals, shortages and the pharmaceutical industry,
  collected from official public sources (HPRA, EMA, CSO, ClinicalTrials.gov, Eurostat, OECD, CORDIS, OpenAlex,
  U.S. FDA, Health Canada, MHRA, NIH) for Ireland and Europe, and published with their source licences,
  a data dictionary and checksums.
